.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/4986.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":8,"globalNumber":4987,"arabic":"فَأَصْحَٰبُ ٱلْمَيْمَنَةِ مَآ أَصْحَٰبُ ٱلْمَيْمَنَةِ","translation":"Then the companions of the right - what are the companions of the right?","transliteration":"Fa as haabul maimanati maaa as haabul maimanah","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/4987.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":9,"globalNumber":4988,"arabic":"وَأَصْحَٰبُ ٱلْمَشْـَٔمَةِ مَآ أَصْحَٰبُ ٱلْمَشْـَٔمَةِ","translation":"And the companions of the left - what are the companions of the left?","transliteration":"Wa as haabul mash'amati maaa as haabul mash'amah","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/4988.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":10,"globalNumber":4989,"arabic":"وَٱلسَّٰبِقُونَ ٱلسَّٰبِقُونَ","translation":"And the forerunners, the forerunners -","transliteration":"Wassaabiqoonas saabiqoon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/4989.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":11,"globalNumber":4990,"arabic":"أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ ٱلْمُقَرَّبُونَ","translation":"Those are the ones brought near [to Allah]","transliteration":"Ulaaa'ikal muqarraboon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/4990.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":12,"globalNumber":4991,"arabic":"فِى جَنَّٰتِ ٱلنَّعِيمِ","translation":"In the Gardens of Pleasure,","transliteration":"Fee Jannaatin Na'eem","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/4991.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":13,"globalNumber":4992,"arabic":"ثُلَّةٌۭ مِّنَ ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","translation":"A [large] company of the former peoples","transliteration":"Sullatum minal awwaleen","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/4992.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":14,"globalNumber":4993,"arabic":"وَقَلِيلٌۭ مِّنَ ٱلْءَاخِرِينَ","translation":"And a few of the later peoples,","transliteration":"Wa qaleelum minal aa khireen","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/4993.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":15,"globalNumber":4994,"arabic":"عَلَىٰ سُرُرٍۢ مَّوْضُونَةٍۢ","translation":"On thrones woven [with ornament],","transliteration":"'Alaa sururim mawdoonah","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/4994.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":16,"globalNumber":4995,"arabic":"مُّتَّكِـِٔينَ عَلَيْهَا مُتَقَٰبِلِينَ","translation":"Reclining on them, facing each other.","transliteration":"Muttaki'eena 'alaihaa mutaqabileen","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/4995.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":17,"globalNumber":4996,"arabic":"يَطُوفُ عَلَيْهِمْ وِلْدَٰنٌۭ مُّخَلَّدُونَ","translation":"There will circulate among them young boys made eternal","transliteration":"Yatoofu 'alaihim wildaa num mukkhalladoon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/4996.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":18,"globalNumber":4997,"arabic":"بِأَكْوَابٍۢ وَأَبَارِيقَ وَكَأْسٍۢ مِّن مَّعِينٍۢ","translation":"With vessels, pitchers and a cup [of wine] from a flowing spring -","transliteration":"Bi akwaabinw wa abaareeq, wa kaasim mim ma'een","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/4997.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":19,"globalNumber":4998,"arabic":"لَّا يُصَدَّعُونَ عَنْهَا وَلَا يُنزِفُونَ","translation":"No headache will they have therefrom, nor will they be intoxicated -","transliteration":"Laa yusadda'oona 'anhaa wa laa yunzifoon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/4998.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":20,"globalNumber":4999,"arabic":"وَفَٰكِهَةٍۢ مِّمَّا يَتَخَيَّرُونَ","translation":"And fruit of what they select","transliteration":"Wa faakihatim mimmaa yatakhaiyaroon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/4999.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":21,"globalNumber":5000,"arabic":"وَلَحْمِ طَيْرٍۢ مِّمَّا يَشْتَهُونَ","translation":"And the meat of fowl, from whatever they desire.","transliteration":"Wa lahmi tairim mimmaa yashtahoon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5000.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":22,"globalNumber":5001,"arabic":"وَحُورٌ عِينٌۭ","translation":"And [for them are] fair women with large, [beautiful] eyes,","transliteration":"Wa hoorun'een","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5001.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":23,"globalNumber":5002,"arabic":"كَأَمْثَٰلِ ٱللُّؤْلُؤِ ٱلْمَكْنُونِ","translation":"The likenesses of pearls well-protected,","transliteration":"Ka amsaalil lu'lu'il maknoon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5002.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":24,"globalNumber":5003,"arabic":"جَزَآءًۢ بِمَا كَانُوا۟ يَعْمَلُونَ","translation":"As reward for what they used to do.","transliteration":"Jazaaa'am bimaa kaanoo ya'maloon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5003.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":25,"globalNumber":5004,"arabic":"لَا يَسْمَعُونَ فِيهَا لَغْوًۭا وَلَا تَأْثِيمًا","translation":"They will not hear therein ill speech or commission of sin -","transliteration":"Laa yasma'oona feehaa laghwanw wa laa taaseemaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5004.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":26,"globalNumber":5005,"arabic":"إِلَّا قِيلًۭا سَلَٰمًۭا سَلَٰمًۭا","translation":"Only a saying: \"Peace, peace.\"","transliteration":"Illaa qeelan salaaman salaamaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5005.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":27,"globalNumber":5006,"arabic":"وَأَصْحَٰبُ ٱلْيَمِينِ مَآ أَصْحَٰبُ ٱلْيَمِينِ","translation":"The companions of the right - what are the companions of the right?","transliteration":"Wa as haabul yameeni maaa as haabul Yameen","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5006.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":28,"globalNumber":5007,"arabic":"فِى سِدْرٍۢ مَّخْضُودٍۢ","translation":"[They will be] among lote trees with thorns removed","transliteration":"Fee sidrim makhdood","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5007.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":29,"globalNumber":5008,"arabic":"وَطَلْحٍۢ مَّنضُودٍۢ","translation":"And [banana] trees layered [with fruit]","transliteration":"Wa talhim mandood","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5008.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":30,"globalNumber":5009,"arabic":"وَظِلٍّۢ مَّمْدُودٍۢ","translation":"And shade extended","transliteration":"Wa zillim mamdood","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5009.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":31,"globalNumber":5010,"arabic":"وَمَآءٍۢ مَّسْكُوبٍۢ","translation":"And water poured out","transliteration":"Wa maaa'im maskoob","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5010.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":32,"globalNumber":5011,"arabic":"وَفَٰكِهَةٍۢ كَثِيرَةٍۢ","translation":"And fruit, abundant [and varied],","transliteration":"Wa faakihatin kaseerah","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5011.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":33,"globalNumber":5012,"arabic":"لَّا مَقْطُوعَةٍۢ وَلَا مَمْنُوعَةٍۢ","translation":"Neither limited [to season] nor forbidden,","transliteration":"Laa maqtoo'atinw wa laa mamnoo'ah","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5012.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":34,"globalNumber":5013,"arabic":"وَفُرُشٍۢ مَّرْفُوعَةٍ","translation":"And [upon] beds raised high.","transliteration":"Wa furushim marfoo'ah","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5013.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":35,"globalNumber":5014,"arabic":"إِنَّآ أَنشَأْنَٰهُنَّ إِنشَآءًۭ","translation":"Indeed, We have produced the women of Paradise in a [new] creation","transliteration":"Innaaa anshaanaahunna inshaaa'aa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5014.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":36,"globalNumber":5015,"arabic":"فَجَعَلْنَٰهُنَّ أَبْكَارًا","translation":"And made them virgins,","transliteration":"Faja'alnaahunna abkaaraa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5015.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":37,"globalNumber":5016,"arabic":"عُرُبًا أَتْرَابًۭا","translation":"Devoted [to their husbands] and of equal age,","transliteration":"'Uruban atraabaa","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5016.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":38,"globalNumber":5017,"arabic":"لِّأَصْحَٰبِ ٱلْيَمِينِ","translation":"For the companions of the right [who are]","transliteration":"Li as haabil yameen","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5017.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":39,"globalNumber":5018,"arabic":"ثُلَّةٌۭ مِّنَ ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","translation":"A company of the former peoples","transliteration":"Sullatum minal awwa leen","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5018.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":40,"globalNumber":5019,"arabic":"وَثُلَّةٌۭ مِّنَ ٱلْءَاخِرِينَ","translation":"And a company of the later peoples.","transliteration":"Wa sullatum minal aakhireen","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5019.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":41,"globalNumber":5020,"arabic":"وَأَصْحَٰبُ ٱلشِّمَالِ مَآ أَصْحَٰبُ ٱلشِّمَالِ","translation":"And the companions of the left - what are the companions of the left?","transliteration":"Wa as haabush shimaali maaa as haabush shimaal","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5020.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":42,"globalNumber":5021,"arabic":"فِى سَمُومٍۢ وَحَمِيمٍۢ","translation":"[They will be] in scorching fire and scalding water","transliteration":"Fee samoominw wa hameem","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5021.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":43,"globalNumber":5022,"arabic":"وَظِلٍّۢ مِّن يَحْمُومٍۢ","translation":"And a shade of black smoke,","transliteration":"Wa zillim miny yahmoom","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5022.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":44,"globalNumber":5023,"arabic":"لَّا بَارِدٍۢ وَلَا كَرِيمٍ","translation":"Neither cool nor beneficial.","transliteration"