quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5029.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":51,"globalNumber":5030,"arabic":"ثُمَّ إِنَّكُمْ أَيُّهَا ٱلضَّآلُّونَ ٱلْمُكَذِّبُونَ","translation":"Then indeed you, O those astray [who are] deniers,","transliteration":"summa innakum ayyuhad daaalloonal mukazziboon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5030.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":52,"globalNumber":5031,"arabic":"لَءَاكِلُونَ مِن شَجَرٍۢ مِّن زَقُّومٍۢ","translation":"Will be eating from trees of zaqqum","transliteration":"La aakiloona min shaja rim min zaqqoom","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5031.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":53,"globalNumber":5032,"arabic":"فَمَالِـُٔونَ مِنْهَا ٱلْبُطُونَ","translation":"And filling with it your bellies","transliteration":"Famaali'oona minhal butoon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5032.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":54,"globalNumber":5033,"arabic":"فَشَٰرِبُونَ عَلَيْهِ مِنَ ٱلْحَمِيمِ","translation":"And drinking on top of it from scalding water","transliteration":"Fashaariboona 'alaihi minal hameem","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5033.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":55,"globalNumber":5034,"arabic":"فَشَٰرِبُونَ شُرْبَ ٱلْهِيمِ","translation":"And will drink as the drinking of thirsty camels.","transliteration":"Fashaariboona shurbal heem","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5034.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":56,"globalNumber":5035,"arabic":"هَٰذَا نُزُلُهُمْ يَوْمَ ٱلدِّينِ","translation":"That is their accommodation on the Day of Recompense.","transliteration":"Haazaa nuzuluhum yawmad deen","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5035.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":57,"globalNumber":5036,"arabic":"نَحْنُ خَلَقْنَٰكُمْ فَلَوْلَا تُصَدِّقُونَ","translation":"We have created you, so why do you not believe?","transliteration":"Nahnu khalaqnaakum falaw laa tusaddiqoon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5036.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":58,"globalNumber":5037,"arabic":"أَفَرَءَيْتُم مَّا تُمْنُونَ","translation":"Have you seen that which you emit?","transliteration":"Afara'aytum maa tumnoon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5037.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":59,"globalNumber":5038,"arabic":"ءَأَنتُمْ تَخْلُقُونَهُۥٓ أَمْ نَحْنُ ٱلْخَٰلِقُونَ","translation":"Is it you who creates it, or are We the Creator?","transliteration":"'A-antum takhluqoo nahooo am nahnul khaaliqoon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5038.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":60,"globalNumber":5039,"arabic":"نَحْنُ قَدَّرْنَا بَيْنَكُمُ ٱلْمَوْتَ وَمَا نَحْنُ بِمَسْبُوقِينَ","translation":"We have decreed death among you, and We are not to be outdone","transliteration":"Nahnu qaddarnaa baina kumul mawta wa maa nahnu bimasbooqeen","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5039.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":61,"globalNumber":5040,"arabic":"عَلَىٰٓ أَن نُّبَدِّلَ أَمْثَٰلَكُمْ وَنُنشِئَكُمْ فِى مَا لَا تَعْلَمُونَ","translation":"In that We will change your likenesses and produce you in that [form] which you do not know.","transliteration":"'Alaaa an nubaddila amsaalakum wa nunshi'akum fee maa laa ta'lamoon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5040.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":62,"globalNumber":5041,"arabic":"وَلَقَدْ عَلِمْتُمُ ٱلنَّشْأَةَ ٱلْأُولَىٰ فَلَوْلَا تَذَكَّرُونَ","translation":"And you have already known the first creation, so will you not remember?","transliteration":"Wa laqad 'alimtumun nash atal oolaa falaw laa tazakkaroon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5041.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":63,"globalNumber":5042,"arabic":"أَفَرَءَيْتُم مَّا تَحْرُثُونَ","translation":"And have you seen that [seed] which you sow?","transliteration":"Afara'aytum maa tahrusoon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5042.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":64,"globalNumber":5043,"arabic":"ءَأَنتُمْ تَزْرَعُونَهُۥٓ أَمْ نَحْنُ ٱلزَّٰرِعُونَ","translation":"Is it you who makes it grow, or are We the grower?","transliteration":"'A-antum tazra'oonahooo am nahnuz zaari'ooon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5043.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":65,"globalNumber":5044,"arabic":"لَوْ نَشَآءُ لَجَعَلْنَٰهُ حُطَٰمًۭا فَظَلْتُمْ تَفَكَّهُونَ","translation":"If We willed, We could make it [dry] debris, and you would remain in wonder,","transliteration":"Law nashaaa'u laja'al naahu hutaaman fazaltum tafakkahoon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5044.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":66,"globalNumber":5045,"arabic":"إِنَّا لَمُغْرَمُونَ","translation":"[Saying], \"Indeed, we are [now] in debt;","transliteration":"Innaa lamughramoon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5045.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":67,"globalNumber":5046,"arabic":"بَلْ نَحْنُ مَحْرُومُونَ","translation":"Rather, we have been deprived.\"","transliteration":"Bal nahnu mahroomoon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5046.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":68,"globalNumber":5047,"arabic":"أَفَرَءَيْتُمُ ٱلْمَآءَ ٱلَّذِى تَشْرَبُونَ","translation":"And have you seen the water that you drink?","transliteration":"Afara'aytumul maaa'allazee tashraboon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5047.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":69,"globalNumber":5048,"arabic":"ءَأَنتُمْ أَنزَلْتُمُوهُ مِنَ ٱلْمُزْنِ أَمْ نَحْنُ ٱلْمُنزِلُونَ","translation":"Is it you who brought it down from the clouds, or is it We who bring it down?","transliteration":"'A-antum anzaltumoohu minal muzni am nahnul munziloon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5048.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":70,"globalNumber":5049,"arabic":"لَوْ نَشَآءُ جَعَلْنَٰهُ أُجَاجًۭا فَلَوْلَا تَشْكُرُونَ","translation":"If We willed, We could make it bitter, so why are you not grateful?","transliteration":"Law nashaaa'u ja'alnaahu ujaajan falaw laa tashkuroon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5049.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":71,"globalNumber":5050,"arabic":"أَفَرَءَيْتُمُ ٱلنَّارَ ٱلَّتِى تُورُونَ","translation":"And have you seen the fire that you ignite?","transliteration":"Afara'aytumun naaral latee tooroon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5050.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":72,"globalNumber":5051,"arabic":"ءَأَنتُمْ أَنشَأْتُمْ شَجَرَتَهَآ أَمْ نَحْنُ ٱلْمُنشِـُٔونَ","translation":"Is it you who produced its tree, or are We the producer?","transliteration":"'A-antum anshaatum shajaratahaaa am nahnul munshi'oon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5051.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":73,"globalNumber":5052,"arabic":"نَحْنُ جَعَلْنَٰهَا تَذْكِرَةًۭ وَمَتَٰعًۭا لِّلْمُقْوِينَ","translation":"We have made it a reminder and provision for the travelers,","transliteration":"Nahnu ja'alnaahaa tazkira tanw wa mataa'al lilmuqween","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5052.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":74,"globalNumber":5053,"arabic":"فَسَبِّحْ بِٱسْمِ رَبِّكَ ٱلْعَظِيمِ","translation":"So exalt the name of your Lord, the Most Great.","transliteration":"Fasabbih bismi Rabbikal 'azeem","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5053.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":75,"globalNumber":5054,"arabic":"۞ فَلَآ أُقْسِمُ بِمَوَٰقِعِ ٱلنُّجُومِ","translation":"Then I swear by the setting of the stars,","transliteration":"Falaa uqsimu bimaawaa qi'innujoom","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5054.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":76,"globalNumber":5055,"arabic":"وَإِنَّهُۥ لَقَسَمٌۭ لَّوْ تَعْلَمُونَ عَظِيمٌ","translation":"And indeed, it is an oath - if you could know - [most] great.","transliteration":"Wa innahoo laqasamul lawta'lamoona'azeem","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5055.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":77,"globalNumber":5056,"arabic":"إِنَّهُۥ لَقُرْءَانٌۭ كَرِيمٌۭ","translation":"Indeed, it is a noble Qur'an","transliteration":"Innahoo la quraanun kareem","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5056.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":78,"globalNumber":5057,"arabic":"فِى كِتَٰبٍۢ مَّكْنُونٍۢ","translation":"In a Register well-protected;","transliteration":"Fee kitaabim maknoon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5057.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":79,"globalNumber":5058,"arabic":"لَّا يَمَسُّهُۥٓ إِلَّا ٱلْمُطَهَّرُونَ","translation":"None touch it except the purified.","transliteration":"Laa yamassuhooo illal mutahharoon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5058.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":80,"globalNumber":5059,"arabic":"تَنزِيلٌۭ مِّن رَّبِّ ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ","translation":"[It is] a revelation from the Lord of the worlds.","transliteration":"Tanzeelum mir Rabbil'aalameen","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5059.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":81,"globalNumber":5060,"arabic":"أَفَبِهَٰذَا ٱلْحَدِيثِ أَنتُم مُّدْهِنُونَ","translation":"Then is it to this statement that you are indifferent","transliteration":"Afabihaazal hadeesi antum mudhinoon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5060.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":82,"globalNumber":5061,"arabic":"وَتَجْعَلُونَ رِزْقَكُمْ أَنَّكُمْ تُكَذِّبُونَ","translation":"And make [the thanks for] your provision that you deny [the Provider]?","transliteration":"Wa taj'aloona rizqakum annakum tukazziboon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5061.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":83,"globalNumber":5062,"arabic":"فَلَوْلَآ إِذَا بَلَغَتِ ٱلْحُلْقُومَ","translation":"Then why, when the soul at death reaches the throat","transliteration":"Falaw laaa izaa balaghatil hulqoom","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5062.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":84,"globalNumber":5063,"arabic":"وَأَنتُمْ حِينَئِذٍۢ تَنظُرُونَ","translation":"And you are at that time looking on -","transliteration":"Wa antum heena'izin tanzuroon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5063.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":85,"globalNumber":5064,"arabic":"وَنَحْنُ أَقْرَبُ إِلَيْهِ مِنكُمْ وَلَٰكِن لَّا تُبْصِرُونَ","translation":"And Our angels are nearer to him than you, but you do not see -","transliteration":"Wa nahnu aqrabu ilaihi minkum wa laakil laa tubsiroon","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5064.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":86,"globalNumber":5065,"arabic":"فَلَوْلَآ إِن كُنتُمْ غَيْرَ مَدِينِينَ","translation":"Then why do you not, if you are not to be recompensed,","transliteration":"Falaw laaa in kuntum ghira madeeneen","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5065.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":87,"globalNumber":5066,"arabic":"تَرْجِعُونَهَآ إِن كُنتُمْ صَٰدِقِينَ","translation":"Bring it back, if you should be truthful?","transliteration":"Tarji'oonahaaa in kuntum saadiqeen","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5066.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":88,"globalNumber":5067,"arabic":"فَأَمَّآ إِن كَانَ مِنَ ٱلْمُقَرَّبِينَ","translation":"And if the deceased was of those brought near to Allah,","transliteration":"Fa ammaaa in kaana minal muqarrabeen","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5067.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":89,"globalNumber":5068,"arabic":"فَرَوْحٌۭ وَرَيْحَانٌۭ وَجَنَّتُ نَعِيمٍۢ","translation":"Then [for him is] rest and bounty and a garden of pleasure.","transliteration":"Farawhunw wa raihaa nunw wa jannatu na'eem","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5068.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":90,"globalNumber":5069,"arabic":"وَأَمَّآ إِن كَانَ مِنْ أَصْحَٰبِ ٱلْيَمِينِ","translation":"And if he was of the companions of the right,","transliteration":"Wa ammaaa in kaana min as haabil yameen","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5069.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":91,"globalNumber":5070,"arabic":"فَسَلَٰمٌۭ لَّكَ مِنْ أَصْحَٰبِ ٱلْيَمِينِ","translation":"Then [the angels will say], \"Peace for you; [you are] from the companions of the right.\"","transliteration":"Fasalaamul laka min as haabil yameen","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5070.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":92,"globalNumber":5071,"arabic":"وَأَمَّآ إِن كَانَ مِنَ ٱلْمُكَذِّبِينَ ٱلضَّآلِّينَ","translation":"But if he was of the deniers [who were] astray,","transliteration":"Wa ammaaa in kaana minal mukazzibeenad daaalleen","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5071.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":93,"globalNumber":5072,"arabic":"فَنُزُلٌۭ مِّنْ حَمِيمٍۢ","translation":"Then [for him is] accommodation of scalding water","transliteration":"Fanuzulum min hameem","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5072.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":94,"globalNumber":5073,"arabic":"وَتَصْلِيَةُ جَحِيمٍ","translation":"And burning in Hellfire","transliteration":"Wa tasliyatu jaheem","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5073.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":95,"globalNumber":5074,"arabic":"إِنَّ هَٰذَا لَهُوَ حَقُّ ٱلْيَقِينِ","translation":"Indeed, this is the true certainty,","transliteration":"Inna haaza lahuwa haqqul yaqeen","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5074.mp3"},{"numberInSurah":96,"globalNumber":5075,"arabic":"فَسَبِّحْ بِٱسْمِ رَبِّكَ ٱلْعَظِيمِ","translation":"So exalt the name of your Lord, the Most Great.","transliteration":"Fasabbih bismi rabbikal 'azeem","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.alafasy/5075.mp3"}]}